 save game file.", "created_at": "2025-01-03T18:13:29Z", "repo": "Demo-Runner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8401bab7ca8ea863f9a97a56b067bdb0e2e47a81", "message": "Move Assets", "created_at": "2025-01-03T01:56:47Z", "repo": "Demo-Runner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bf5f6239bfa6180dabd3b02c25bc81669729a281", "message": "Import Car Assets", "created_at": "2025-01-03T01:52:13Z", "repo": "Demo-Runner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2ebcbee3f6a8a2f1baf67eff6114238c2e50bb26", "message": "[BUG FIX] The player character end up in the wrong lane\n\n- Introduce a variable, bIsSwitchingLane, to track whether the player is currently transitioning between lanes. Use this variable to control whether lane switching is allowed.\n\n- https://yenteho.atlassian.net/browse/GAME1-367?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiN2E2YmQ5NzdiYWE5NGMwNjkxYjQ4MDA1NGFhZDk5ZjUiLCJwIjoiaiJ9", "created_at": "2025-01-02T00:37:12Z", "repo": "Demo-Runner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7bd1dcf00e652c5683e29752bf14f5da17065a64", "message": "Resuming Gameplay\n\n- Update `BP_RunnerCharacter`\n\t- Add variable bIsDead and set it up in function BeginPlay, and Death\n\t- Add function \"ResumeGame\"\n\t\t- Unset bIsDead\n\t\t- Respawn player\n\t\t- Call destroyer to remove obstacles\n\t\t- Enable player input and disable simulate physic\n\t\t- Load gameplay widget\n\t\t- Unset game pause\n\n- Create `BP_ObstacleDestroyer`\n\t- Destroy obstacles at the player respawn location, then destroy destroyer itself\n\n- Update `WBP_GameOver`\n\t- Add Resume button to call resume widget\n\n- Create user widget `WBP_ResumePopup`\n\t- Add message to warn user that coins will be deducted if resume the game\n\t- Add option \"YES\", \"NO\", \"CLOSE\". When user has enough coins, display \"YES\", \"NO\", otherwise display \"CLOSE\"\n\t- deduct coins and resume game when player select \"YES\"\n\n- Update `WBP_GamePlay`, `WBP_MainMenu`, `BP_RunerCharacter`, `BP_Coins`, `BP_RunnerGameInstance`\n\t- Centralize coins and highscore data save and retrieval to game instance", "created_at": "2025-01-01T02:15:54Z", "repo": "Demo-Runner", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": [{"created_at": "2024-01-23T18:54:41Z", "body_length": 24}, {"created_at": "2024-01-23T18:51:42Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2025-02-25T17:30:25Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2025-01-09T17:31:14Z", "body_length": 0}]}